@startuml
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor khaki
    ParticipantBackgroundColor lightgoldenrodyellow
}

participant 库存服务 as QS order 10
entity 规则Squirrel as RS order 20
entity 交易库存Squirrel as BS order 30

QS -> RS++: 查库存 rule 配置
return

QS -> QS: 分离出【交易库存】并为其构造查询参数

QS -> BS++: 并行查询所有维度（原补贴维度抽象为交易维度，包含补贴/桌台等）
return

QS -> QS: 合并查询结果（至返回结果中

@enduml